  "description": "<h1 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">&bull; Brand:</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Hoznext&nbsp;is the story of being an online store for custom Valorant shoes. As a small business founded in 2022 by one person then more creative people join&nbsp;that&nbsp;are passionate about providing unique and personalized footwear for gamers who are fans of the popular game Valorant.</span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">&bull; Product description:</span> </span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">At Hoznext, we understand the importance of finding the perfect pair of shoes that not only look good but also feel great and comfortable. That's why we offer a wide range of shoes, including popular models like Air Force 1 and working on Air Jordan 1, Dunk Low, High Canvas, and Low Canvas to be out for you soon.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Our shoes are designed with attention to detail, using modern printing technics high-quality materials to ensure durability and long-lasting performance. The wear-resistant rubber soles provide excellent traction, while the microfiber leather uppers offer a sleek and stylish look. Additionally, our EVA padded insoles provide superior comfort, making our shoes suitable for all-day wear.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Contact email: <a href=\"https://hoznext.com/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">support@hoznext.com</a></span></p>",
